      ✅ Lunch Menu<br><br>
      This is a strong match because the keyword appears directly in the page title.
    </div>
  </details>

  <details style="background:#F5F7F8;border-radius:14px;padding:18px;box-shadow:2px 2px 8px rgba(0,0,0,0.1);">
