<div style="background-color:#B7E0E5;border-radius:30px;color:#000000;width:95%;padding:18px 24px;margin:24px 0;">

<p style="font-size:18px;line-height:1.5;margin:0;">
<strong>💡 Key Idea:</strong> Search is about matching a user’s query to data. The results depend on what the program checks, such as titles, keywords, spelling, or exact words.
</p>

